
# Data Flow Diagram for Property Creation Workflow

UI.PropertyWizard -> Controller

Controller -> Session.WizardState: Store/Retrieve Wizard State

Controller -> AzureBlobStorageService: Upload Temporary Photos
AzureBlobStorageService -> AzureBlobStorage: Store Temp Blobs
AzureBlobStorage -> AzureBlobStorageService: Retrieve Temp Blobs
AzureBlobStorageService -> Controller: Return Temp Paths

Controller -> PropertyRepository: Submit Property Data
PropertyRepository -> SQLServer: Create Property & Amenities
SQLServer -> PropertyRepository: Return PropertyId

Controller -> AzureBlobStorageService: Copy Temp to Permanent
AzureBlobStorageService -> AzureBlobStorage: Store Permanent Blobs
AzureBlobStorageService -> Controller: Return Permanent Paths

Controller -> PropertyRepository: Add Photo Metadata
PropertyRepository -> SQLServer: Persist Photo Metadata

Controller -> ListingRepository: Submit Listing Data
ListingRepository -> SQLServer: Create Listing
SQLServer -> ListingRepository: Return ListingId
ListingRepository -> SQLServer: Add Listing Photo Metadata

AzureBlobStorageService -> AzureBlobStorage: Store Permanent Listing Blobs
AzureBlobStorageService -> Controller: Return Permanent Listing Paths

Controller -> Session.WizardState: Clear Session & Temp Photos
Session.WizardState -> AzureBlobStorageService: Delete Temp Blobs
